+ * block signature (ARK0_SLH_BLOCK_HEIGHT). Both take it from here, so that the two rules start at
+ * the same block and the height is written once.
+ *
+ * 55000 is the height chosen for M4-T and M4-B and fixed in the code, above the height that created
+ * the three lattice tripwire outputs. Once a build carrying it has left the network's own nodes, it
+ * does not change.
+ */
+inline constexpr int ARK0_H4T{55000};
+
